ressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKATSUCHI, MASAHARU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SASAKI, KEIZABURO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TANAKA, YASUNORI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WADA, HIROMI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A message delivery system comprising a client device and a server device. The client device makes a request to send a delivery message according to the notification from the server device, receives the delivery message from the server device, and sends, after the reception of the delivery message, a request to deliver the next message, if any, and an instruction request that the server device is to process the delivery message which the client has received. The server device sends a message to the client according to the request of a delivery message from the client device, sends the delivery message, and processes the message which the client device has received according to the instruction of the client device.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Ce système de remise de messages comprend un dispositif client et un dispositif serveur. Le dispositif client demande l'envoi d'un message de remise, en fonction de l'avis provenant du dispositif serveur, il reçoit le message de remise à partir du dispositif serveur et envoie, après réception de ce message, une demande de remise du message suivant, le cas échéant, ainsi qu'une demande d'instruction au dispositif serveur d'avoir à traiter le message de remise, reçu par le client. Le dispositif serveur envoie un message au client en fonction de la demande d'un message de remise provenant du dispositif client, envoie le message de remise et traite le message reçu par le dispositif client, en fonction de l'instruction du dispositif client.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>